<title>INDIA: India to sell 30 bln rupees of 3-yr securities.</title>
<headline>India to sell 30 bln rupees of 3-yr securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>India on Tuesday announced the auction of 30 billion rupees of three-year government securities on May 28.</p>
<p>The government stock is eligible for the ready forward facility, the government said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
